## Dimension 3: Security

### Applicable Guardrails
- **AUTH-004:** Authorization Required — upload endpoints require valid JWT with correct scope; unauthenticated uploads rejected
- **SEC-001:** TLS Encryption — file upload transport over TLS 1.2+
### Security Requirements
- File type validation performed server-side (not client-side only) — MIME type and file signature (magic bytes) checked
- Maximum file size enforced server-side to prevent resource exhaustion
- Uploaded files scanned for malware/malicious content before being placed in inbox (integration with platform-level AV scanning)
- Temporary pre-commit buffer inaccessible to other users or sessions

