## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance

### KPIs
- Upload success rate (completed without error)
- Preview render time (file received → preview displayed to user)
- Commit success rate (preview confirmed → document in inbox)
- Discard rate at preview (proxy for scan/upload quality issues)

### OTEL Spans
- `documents.upload.initiated` — user triggers upload action; file count recorded (1 for single, n for multi-file batch); `upload_method` attribute records `file_picker` or `drag_drop`
- `documents.upload.received` — file received by server, integrity check passed; batch sequence position recorded
- `documents.upload.preview_rendered` — preview displayed to user; batch sequence position recorded
- `documents.upload.committed` — user confirms; document moves to inbox; batch sequence position recorded
- `documents.upload.discarded` — user discards at preview; temporary buffer purged; batch sequence position recorded
- `documents.upload.failed` — upload failed with error type recorded

### SLOs
- Preview render: p95 < 3 seconds for files up to 50MB
- Upload commit: p95 < 5 seconds from user confirmation to document appearing in inbox
- Upload success rate: ≥ 99% for valid, non-corrupt files
- File integrity check: 100% of uploads validated before preview is rendered

