## PxD (Added by V1d)

> **Scope:** Full PxD. Three net-new screens: Upload Zone, Upload Preview, Upload Complete. All layout decisions from prototype v8 (Screen 10–12). TWAIN direct scanner out of scope for Phase 1.

---

### User Flow

**Primary Flow — Single file upload:**
1. Admin is on any Documents Manager screen; toolbar shows "⬆ Upload" `Button variant="filled"` (RHS, shared toolbar)
2. Admin clicks "⬆ Upload" — navigates to Upload Zone screen (dedicated screen, SPA route)
3. Upload Zone renders: drag-and-drop zone + CLIN-007 callout + TWAIN-deferred callout + supported formats list
4. Admin selects one file via file picker (or drags file onto zone)
5. Upload Preview screen renders immediately: CLIN-007 review prompt + filename/size header + document viewer rendering the file content + metadata form + Confirm / Discard actions
6. Admin reviews document content and fills in metadata (document type, date of care, date received, title)
7. Admin clicks "Confirm & continue" → Upload Complete screen renders
8. Upload Complete: success icon + summary + CTA to Unmatched queue or "Upload more"

**Alternative Flow — Batch upload (multiple files):**
1–4. Same as primary flow; admin selects 2+ files
5. Batch progress bar appears at top: fraction indicator (e.g. "1 / 3") + filename + step dots
6. Each file previewed individually in sequence; Confirm advances to next file; Discard skips that file and advances
7. Discarded files are purged immediately (no temporary buffer retained — CLIN-007, IG-001)
8. After last file: Upload Complete screen; discard note shown if any files were discarded
9. Confirmed documents routed to Unmatched queue with `source = Manual Upload`

**Error Flow — Invalid / corrupt file:**
1. Admin uploads file that fails integrity check (corrupt, unsupported format, zero-byte)
2. Upload Preview renders with error state: red error box "File rejected — cannot be previewed or committed"; error detail message; CLIN-010 note confirming no buffer was written
3. CLIN-007 review prompt and Confirm/Discard actions are hidden; only "← Back to upload" shown
4. Admin returns to Upload Zone; no document stored

**Exit Types:**
- **Complete:** All files confirmed → Upload Complete screen → navigate to Unmatched queue
- **Cancel:** "← Document Manager" back link at any upload screen → returns to Filing Queue; no documents stored if no files confirmed yet
- **Discard (per file):** Discards individual file in batch; batch continues; purged immediately; audited
- **Abandon:** Browser/SPA navigate-away from upload flow — any uncommitted files purged; no partial state retained

