### Component Specifications

> 🚫 All components use `@emisgroup/ui-*` exclusively.

**Upload Zone (drop target):**
- Container: `<div>` with `onDragOver`, `onDragLeave`, `onDrop` handlers; `aria-label={t('upload.zone.label')}` `role="region"`
- Hidden file input: `<input type="file" multiple accept=".pdf,.tiff,.tif,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.docx,.rtf" className="sr-only" id="fileInput" />`; triggered by zone click
- `Button variant="filled"` labelled `{t('upload.zone.browse')}` — keyboard-accessible alternative to drag; `htmlFor="fileInput"`
- Drag-active state: `border-color: var(--primary); background: var(--hover)` via CSS class toggle
- Supported formats label: `<p aria-live="off">` static text only
- CLIN-007 callout: `Banner variant="warning"` — non-dismissable
- TWAIN callout: `Banner variant="info"` — non-dismissable

**Batch Progress Bar:**
- Container: `<div role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-label={t('upload.batch.progress', { current, total })}>` 
- Fraction: `<span>{t('upload.batch.fraction', { current, total })}</span>` (e.g. "1 / 3")
- Filename: `<span>` truncated with `text-overflow: ellipsis`
- Step dots: `<ol>` of `<li>` items; completed = filled dot `var(--positive)`; current = filled `var(--primary)`; pending = outline `var(--border)`
- Visible only when `totalFiles > 1`

**Preview File Header:**
- Icon: `Icon ~icons/ic/outline-insert-drive-file` 20px `var(--text-dim)`
- Filename: `<span>` 13px semibold `var(--text)`
- Size + type: `<span>` 12px regular `var(--text-dim)`

**Metadata Form (preview step):**
- Document type: `Select aria-label={t('upload.meta.docType')} invalid={attempted && !docType}` — required
- Date of care: `DatePicker aria-label={t('upload.meta.dateOfCare')}`
- Date received: `DatePicker aria-label={t('upload.meta.dateReceived')}` — pre-populated with today
- Title: `Input aria-label={t('upload.meta.title')} clearable`
- Layout: single row on desktop; stacked on mobile

**Confirm / Discard Actions:**
- Back: `Button variant="mono"` `{t('upload.preview.back')}`
- Discard: `Button variant="danger"` `{t('upload.preview.discard')}` — opens confirmation `Dialog` before purging
- Confirm: `Button variant="filled"` `{t('upload.preview.confirm')}` — disabled until document type selected

**Invalid File Error Box:**
- Container: `<div role="alert" aria-live="assertive">`
- Heading: `<h4>` `var(--negative)` — `{t('upload.error.rejected.heading')}`
- Detail: `<p>` file-specific error message from API
- CLIN-010 note: `<p>` `var(--text-dim)` small
- Actions: Back `Button variant="mono"` only — no Confirm/Discard

**Upload Complete CTA block:**
- Primary: `Button variant="filled"` `{t('upload.complete.viewUnmatched')}` → navigates to Unmatched tab
- Secondary: `Button variant="mono"` `{t('upload.complete.uploadMore')}` → returns to Upload Zone

