- Step dot complete: `var(--positive)`
- Step dot current: `var(--primary)`
- Step dot pending: `var(--border)`

**Typography:** Enterprise Sans; heading 22px bold; body 13–14px; meta 12px `var(--text-dim)`

**Spacing:** 8px grid; 48px vertical padding in upload zone; 16px between sections

**Icons:** `~icons/ic/outline-cloud-upload` 40px in drop zone; `~icons/ic/outline-insert-drive-file` 20px in preview header

---

### Error States

**Invalid / corrupt file:** `role="alert"` box — red heading, file-specific detail, CLIN-010 note, Back-only actions. No Confirm/Discard shown.

**Unsupported file type (client-side):** Inline `Notification variant="error"` below drop zone: `{t('upload.error.unsupportedType', { filename, accepted })}`. File not passed to preview.

**Upload API failure (server-side):** `Notification variant="error"` persistent (no auto-dismiss) on preview screen: `{t('upload.error.serverFailure')}`. Retry button shown.

**Network timeout:** `Notification variant="error"` persistent: `{t('upload.error.timeout')}`. Retry button shown.

---

### Empty States

No empty state needed — Upload Zone always renders drop zone content regardless of prior uploads.

